{"id":"413ee4c6aedeb326","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-local-modal-consequence.md","title":"Finite Local Modal Consequence","display":"df-local-modal-consequence — Finite Local Modal Consequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-local-modal-consequence","aliases":["89-df-local-modal-consequence"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"df-local-modal-consequence — Finite Local Modal Consequence","depends_on":["[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","[[89-df-modal-sequent]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-local-modal-consequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-local-modal-consequence</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"df-local-modal-consequence — Finite Local Modal Consequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca21b68a25f1afc2\" href=\"?note=ca21b68a25f1afc2\" title=\"89-df-modal-sequent\">89-df-modal-sequent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\">\\(\\bigwedge\\)</span> 是有限序列合取，空序列合取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}\">\\(\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}\\)</span> 是下文定义的元层关系，参数依次为公式集合和公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}modal\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\n\\Gamma\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\Gamma^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(\\bigwedge\\Delta\\to A)\\in L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}modal\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\n\\Gamma\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\Gamma^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(\\bigwedge\\Delta\\to A)\\in L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 85–87；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>这是世界假设的有限命题后果关系。必然化只作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的定理；从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\Gamma\">\\(p\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 不能径直推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}\\Box p\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}\\Box p\\)</span>。空假设时恰有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}A\\iff A\\in L\">\\(\\varnothing\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}A\\iff A\\in L\\)</span>。有限序列允许重复，重言式保证重新排序与去重不改变可推导性。本定义把第 6 章有限一致性测试所用的局部后果显式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"ca21b68a25f1afc2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}modal\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\n\\Gamma\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\Gamma^{<\\omega}\\;\n(\\bigwedge\\Delta\\to A)\\in L.","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}A\\iff A\\in L","display":false}],"bytes":1396,"backlinks":[{"id":"0455ac768bd466bb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"92c4449a6fa3b997","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-local-modal-consequence]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]] → [[89-df-local-modal-consequence]] → [[89-lem-local-modal-deduction]] → [[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]] → [[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]] → [[89-df-canonical-model]] → [[89-lem-canonical-successor]] → [[89-lem-canonical-truth]] → [[89-thm-canonical-model]]"}],"outgoing":["bdef52f3ff411531","ca21b68a25f1afc2"]}